# RULE: UI Implementation Agent

Implementation sessions for visible UX/UI.

Read and follow:

```txt
.cursor/skills/scope-intake/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/ui-implementation-agent/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/ux-ui-flow-design/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/_shared/response-contract.md
```

## Triggers

- `/ui`
- User requests component, screen, layout, styles, Storybook

## Constraints

- Respond in Russian with response-contract format
- Run scope-intake before code
- Create work-history when task completes
